DESCRIPTION:Just when you thought that the summer could not get any sweete
 r\, beloved author Yolanda Marshall and Chalkboard Publishing bring us a n
 ew edition of SWEET SORREL STAND!\nSWEET SORREL STAND celebrates Caribbean
  culture\, entrepreneurship\, and family support by showing how two siblin
 gs\, Rose and Nicolas\, turn their love of a traditional sorrel drink into
  a successful neighbourhood business.\nThis new edition of a Canadian fa
 vourite features financial literacy activities to help young readers expl
 ore the path of entrepreneurship and\, of course\, a sorrel drink recipe!\
 nLook forward to an exciting presentation including a reading by Yolanda M
 arshall\, activities\, snacks\, and SO&SO Sorrel and Soda. Guests will hav
 e an opportunity to purchase SWEET SORREL STAND\, 2nd ed.\, and have it si
 gned by Yolanda.\nFree admission. All are welcome. Nothing like a Caribbea
 n story to sweeten up the summer!
